  "description": {
    "raw": "You set a magical ward upon the object touched, which must be a container such as a pouch, bag, backpack, or pocket. If any creature opens the container without first speaking a command word, 1d3 summoned venomous snakes (Pathfinder RPG Bestiary 255) appear, slithering out of the container and attacking that creature for 1 round/level before disappearing. They attack other creatures only if they themselves are attacked.",
    "search_text": "\"you set a magical ward upon the object touched, which must be a container such as a pouch, bag, backpack, or pocket. if any creature opens the container without first speaking a command word, 1d3 summoned venomous snakes (pathfinder rpg bestiary 255) appear, slithering out of the container and attacking that creature for 1 round/level before disappearing. they attack other creatures only if they themselves are attacked.\"",
